# Secrets / credentials — must never be baked into the image (defence in
# depth for docker:S6470; the recursive `COPY . .` build step relies on this).
# Note: plain `.env` is intentionally NOT excluded — `composer dump-env prod`
# reads it at build time and it holds only non-secret defaults.
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*.crt
**/*.p12
**/*.pfx
secrets/
.secrets/
**/*.secret
